OL,3,CMourners gather for Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cfuneral
OL,6,FFamily, friends and colleagues are
OL,7,Fgathering to say goodbye to former
OL,8,FTory minister Ann Widdecombe.
OL,10,FHer funeral service is taking place
OL,11,Flater at the Catholic abbey where she
OL,12,Fregularly worshipped.
OL,14,FA requiem mass will be held for the
OL,15,Fformer MP, who later became a Reform
OL,16,FUK spokeswoman, at Buckfast Abbey in
OL,17,FDevon.
OL,19,FMiss Widdecombe, 78, was a frequent
OL,20,Fworshipper in the Abbey Church.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
