OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786513672
OL,3,CMourners gather for Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cfuneral
OL,6,FShe died on July 8 after she was hit
OL,7,Fover the head with a hammer 21 times
OL,8,Fat her home in Haytor on Dartmoor,
OL,9,FDevon.
OL,11,FJoshua Kerry, 28, of Rotherham, South
OL,12,FYorkshire, was charged with her murder
OL,13,Fon July 20.
OL,15,FThe private requiem mass will include
OL,16,Fa homily from the Rt Rev David
OL,17,FCharlesworth, Abbot of Buckfast.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
