OL,3,CMourners gather for Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cfuneral
OL,6,FA statement from the abbey said Miss
OL,7,FWiddecombe would be "missed and fondly
OL,8,Fremembered" and "many in our
OL,9,Fworshipping community knew her as a
OL,10,Fkind and warm character".
OL,12,F"Ann was a woman of profound faith, a
OL,13,Ffaith which found expression in the
OL,14,Fpublic forum of politics," the
OL,15,Fstatement said.
OL,17,F"Ann was unafraid to express her
OL,18,Funwavering convictions, formed through
OL,19,Fher Roman Catholic faith. She had a
OL,20,Fsharp intellect and was a dedicated
OL,21,Fpublic servant."
