OL,3,CMourners gather for Ann Widdecombe's
OL,4,Cfuneral
OL,6,FA public memorial for Miss Widdecombe
OL,7,Fwill be held later this year.
OL,9,F"Ann was a woman of profound faith, a
OL,10,Ffaith which found expression in the
OL,11,Fpublic forum of politics," the
OL,12,Fstatement said.
OL,14,F"Ann was unafraid to express her
OL,15,Funwavering convictions, formed through
OL,16,Fher Roman Catholic faith. She had a
OL,17,Fsharp intellect and was a dedicated
OL,18,Fpublic servant."
OL,20,FA public memorial for Miss Widdecombe
OL,21,Fwill be held later this year.
